we are here on earth to find ourselves first,

1602
00:55:05.516 --> 00:55:09.010
and that requires some self-reliance and independence,

1603
00:55:09.010 --> 00:55:11.410
but it also requires some mutual dependence

1604
00:55:11.410 --> 00:55:12.340
and interconnection.

1605
00:55:12.340 --> 00:55:13.290
And it's all,

1606
00:55:13.290 --> 00:55:15.700
it's all this like equation that we're trying

1607
00:55:15.700 --> 00:55:16.970
