1610
00:55:21.390 --> 00:55:22.223
When you find,

1611
00:55:22.223 --> 00:55:23.510
like when the person,

1612
00:55:23.510 --> 00:55:26.160
the Bodhisattva has meditation to achieve equanimity

1613
00:55:26.160 --> 00:55:27.420
