1614
00:55:27.420 --> 00:55:28.990
Well, what does equanimity mean?

1615
00:55:28.990 --> 00:55:29.823
Right.

1616
00:55:29.823 --> 00:55:30.656
It means,

1617
00:55:30.656 --> 00:55:32.277
no one achieves it in their day-to-day life.

1618
00:55:32.277 --> 00:55:33.950
And so yes,

1619
00:55:33.950 --> 00:55:37.230
in terms of how do you get the best conditions

1620
00:55:37.230 --> 00:55:40.210
for you to feel comfortable in your skin,

1621
00:55:40.210 --> 00:55:41.210
comfortable in your life,

1622
00:55:41.210 --> 00:55:42.510
having your family do well,

1623
00:55:42.510 --> 00:55:45.650
having your career do well, all that balance sheet.

1624
00:55:45.650 --> 00:55:46.483
It seems, to me,

1625
00:55:46.483 --> 00:55:48.740
we're talking like life's balance sheet

1626
00:55:50.225 --> 00:55:54.040
and it's like that's a moving,

1627
00:55:54.040 --> 00:55:56.307
