00:56:46.049 --> 00:56:47.240
Yeah, that's the illusion, right?

1657
00:56:47.240 --> 00:56:48.073
Yeah.

1658
00:56:48.073 --> 00:56:48.930
You think ah, it's going good.

1659
00:56:48.930 --> 00:56:49.763
It's going good.

1660
