1671
00:57:09.250 --> 00:57:13.490
that pain is the driver of quality.

1672
00:57:13.490 --> 00:57:14.370
Right.

1673
00:57:14.370 --> 00:57:15.710
Which is not a healthy-

1674
00:57:15.710 --> 00:57:18.180
No, so I think whether you're feeling doubt

