01:58:46.210 --> 01:58:48.393
Nature sounds, whatever does it for you.

3418
01:58:49.430 --> 01:58:50.263
Cool.

3419
01:58:50.263 --> 01:58:51.096
But hey, thanks for the question.

3420
01:58:51.096 --> 01:58:51.929
I thought that was helpful.

3421
01:58:51.929 --> 01:58:52.762
Thank you, Kevin.

3422
01:58:52.762 --> 01:58:55.522
Yeah, and thanks for the great recording.

3423
01:58:55.522 --> 01:58:56.680
That's right.

3424
01:58:56.680 --> 01:58:57.600
His own mic.

3425
01:58:57.600 --> 01:58:58.691
I know.

3426
01:58:58.691 --> 01:59:00.210
