3435
01:59:20.070 --> 01:59:21.720
I got two questions for you guys.

3436
01:59:21.720 --> 01:59:26.130
One, what book would you bring on a road trip for yourself?

3437
01:59:26.130 --> 01:59:27.374
And secondly,

3438
01:59:27.374 --> 01:59:29.810
Adam I know you're looking for running questions,

3439
01:59:29.810 --> 01:59:32.460
so I've been a road runner my whole life

3440
01:59:32.460 --> 01:59:33.900
and I'm excited to hit the trail.

3441
01:59:33.900 --> 01:59:37.090
What tips do you have for me to transition from pavement

3442
01:59:37.090 --> 01:59:38.110
